    "text": "**Business & market dynamics:** Grove Collaborative is navigating a deliberate contraction, with a shrinking active customer base and declining order volumes driving a meaningful pullback in top-line activity. However, the underlying quality of the business is improving markedly as the company shifts toward higher-value, loyal customers through its Grove Green Rewards program. This repositioning is boosting gross margins and has flipped profitability metrics into positive territory for a second consecutive quarter, while cash consumption has narrowed sharply, suggesting the business is stabilizing on a healthier, if smaller, foundation.\n\n**Management strategy and execution:** Leadership is executing a clear pivot from growth-at-all-costs to profitable sustainability. The emphasis on a membership-based loyalty model and more disciplined, targeted promotional spending is delivering tangible operational leverage. Management’s confidence in this trajectory is underscored by raising full-year revenue guidance, signaling that the deliberate recalibration is gaining traction and that the worst of the customer attrition may be moderating. The team is now credibly demonstrating a path toward breakeven operations after a period of deep losses.",
